Short : HD-Installer for Zany Golf
Type : game/patch
Author : Bored Seal

This patch applies to "Zany Golf" by Electronic Arts (c) 1988.
Slave requires WHDLOAD V10+.
Game requires 0.5MB ChipRAM (+ 0.7MB RAM for PreLoad)

FEATURES:
- Full load from HD
- Disk protection removed
- Trainer key added (pressing F10 will give you 9 strokes)
- OS emulation module used
- ROM/NI icon (created by JHZ)
- Quit option (your default key)

HISTORY:
v1.0 (05-Aug-2000) - first release
V1.1 (23-Jul-2006) - disk access removed, files moved to "data" subdirectory


Thanks to Jan Vieten for disk image.

         Bug report form, full WHDLoad package and other installs:
